nt decomposition 2, dw_4061 idiom).\n\n**3c. Wording anchoring:** \"academic year 2024\" → COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.ACADEMIC_YEAR (year_columns decision guide); \"Mathematics department (Course 18)\" → DEPARTMENT_NAME = 'Mathematics' (domain knowledge); \"offered this year\" → IS_OFFERED_THIS_YEAR = 'Y'; \"total units greater than zero\" → TOTAL_UNITS > 0.\n\n**3d. Precedents:** dw_2210 uses the exact same join/filter/window shape (1 precedent, same task family); dw_4061 uses EXP(AVG(LN(TOTAL_UNITS))) on COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED (geometric-mean precedent); dw_2377 uses COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED ⋈ CIS_COURSE_CATALOG with IS_OFFERED_THIS_YEAR='Y' for Mathematics.\n\n### 4. Business Usage\nCOURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED is the default catalog source for unit statistics, grade rules, and offering flags (concept decision_guide). CIS_COURSE_CATALOG is used as a cross-source existence/attribute feed. SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION attributes courses to departments and course levels and is used in department-level statistics (dw_2272, dw_2365, hint decomposition 2).\n\n### 5. Coverage Checklist\n- COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED: semantic_get, semantic_graph (neighbors) ✓\n- CIS_COURSE_CATALOG: semantic_get ✓\n- SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION: semantic_get ✓\n- dw_2210, dw_2377, dw_4061: semantic_get (full SQL) ✓\n- column_concept_total_units / department_name / subject_id / year_columns: semantic_get ✓\n- concept_course_catalog_sources: semantic_get ✓\n- Other Phase-1 tables (SIS_SUBJECT_CODE, SIS_DEPARTMENT, DRUPAL_COURSE_CATALOG, SUBJECT_* offering tables, ACADEMIC_TERMS): retrieved via search descs and graph neighbors; not needed for this task's join path (evidence: hint decomposition uses only the three gold tables).\n- mysql_query: attempted 7 times — all failed with \"Access denied for user 'root'@'localhost'\"; execution verification impossible.\n\n### 6. Recommendation\n\n**6a.** Use COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED (all 11 attribute columns + window min over DEPARTM